### BildyApp API — REST Client (VS Code REST Client extension)
### Actualiza @token después de login

@host     = http://localhost:3000
@base     = {{host}}/api
@token    = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@refresh  = PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE
@clientId = PASTE_CLIENT_ID_HERE
@projectId= PASTE_PROJECT_ID_HERE
@noteId   = PASTE_NOTE_ID_HERE

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# USUARIOS
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 1. Registro
POST {{base}}/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@bildyapp.com",
  "password": "Secret123!"
}

###

### 2. Verificar email (código de 6 dígitos desde logs/DB)
PUT {{base}}/user/validation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "code": "123456"
}

###

### 3. Login
POST {{base}}/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@bildyapp.com",
  "password": "Secret123!"
}

###

### 4. Onboarding — datos personales
PUT {{base}}/user/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Alice",
  "lastName": "García",
  "nif": "12345678A"
}

###

### 5. Onboarding — empresa
PATCH {{base}}/user/company
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "isFreelance": false,
  "name": "Bildy S.L.",
  "cif": "B12345678",
  "address": {
    "street": "Calle Mayor",
    "number": "10",
    "postal": "28001",
    "city": "Madrid",
    "province": "Madrid"
  }
}

###

### 5b. Onboarding — autónomo
PATCH {{base}}/user/company
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "isFreelance": true
}

###

### 6. Obtener usuario
GET {{base}}/user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 7. Refresh token
POST {{base}}/user/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}"
}

###

### 8. Logout
POST {{base}}/user/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 9. Cambiar contraseña
PUT {{base}}/user/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "oldPassword": "Secret123!",
  "newPassword": "NewSecret456@"
}

###

### 10. Invitar compañero (requiere rol admin)
POST {{base}}/user/invite
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "email": "bob@bildyapp.com",
  "name": "Bob",
  "lastName": "Martínez"
}

###

### 11. Eliminar usuario (soft delete)
DELETE {{base}}/user?soft=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CLIENTES
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 12. Crear cliente
POST {{base}}/client
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Constructora Pérez S.A.",
  "cif": "A12345678",
  "email": "contacto@perez.com",
  "phone": "910000001",
  "address": {
    "street": "Avenida de la Industria",
    "number": "42",
    "postal": "28100",
    "city": "Alcobendas",
    "province": "Madrid"
  }
}

###

### 13. Listar clientes (con paginación y filtros)
GET {{base}}/client?page=1&limit=10&search=Pérez
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 14. Obtener cliente por ID
GET {{base}}/client/{{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 15. Actualizar cliente
PUT {{base}}/client/{{clientId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Constructora Pérez Renovada S.A.",
  "email": "nuevo@perez.com"
}

###

### 16. Archivar cliente (soft delete)
DELETE {{base}}/client/{{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 17. Restaurar cliente archivado
PATCH {{base}}/client/{{clientId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PROYECTOS
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 18. Crear proyecto
POST {{base}}/project
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "client": "{{clientId}}",
  "name": "Reforma Oficina Central",
  "projectCode": "PRJ-2026-001",
  "address": {
    "street": "Calle Gran Vía",
    "number": "28",
    "postal": "28013",
    "city": "Madrid",
    "province": "Madrid"
  },
  "notes": "Incluye derribo de tabiques y pintura"
}

###

### 19. Listar proyectos
GET {{base}}/project?page=1&limit=10&search=Oficina
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 20. Obtener proyecto por ID
GET {{base}}/project/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 21. Actualizar proyecto
PUT {{base}}/project/{{projectId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Reforma Oficina Central — Fase 2",
  "notes": "Segunda fase: instalaciones eléctricas"
}

###

### 22. Archivar proyecto (soft delete)
DELETE {{base}}/project/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 23. Restaurar proyecto archivado
PATCH {{base}}/project/{{projectId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ALBARANES
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 24. Crear albarán (horas)
POST {{base}}/deliverynote
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "client": "{{clientId}}",
  "project": "{{projectId}}",
  "format": "hours",
  "description": "Jornada de instalación eléctrica",
  "workDate": "2026-04-28",
  "hours": 8,
  "workers": [
    { "name": "Carlos López", "hours": 4 },
    { "name": "María Gómez", "hours": 4 }
  ]
}

###

### 25. Crear albarán (material)
POST {{base}}/deliverynote
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "client": "{{clientId}}",
  "project": "{{projectId}}",
  "format": "material",
  "description": "Suministro de cable eléctrico",
  "workDate": "2026-04-29",
  "material": "Cable eléctrico 2.5mm",
  "quantity": 150,
  "unit": "metros"
}

###

### 26. Listar albaranes (con filtros)
GET {{base}}/deliverynote?page=1&limit=10&format=hours
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 27. Obtener albarán por ID (con datos populados)
GET {{base}}/deliverynote/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 28. Descargar PDF del albarán
GET {{base}}/deliverynote/{{noteId}}/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 29. Firmar albarán (multipart — campo "signature")
# PATCH {{base}}/deliverynote/{{noteId}}/sign
# Content-Type: multipart/form-data
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# Body: form-data → signature: [imagen PNG/JPG]

###

### 30. Eliminar albarán (solo no firmados)
DELETE {{base}}/deliverynote/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# DASHBOARD
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 31. Dashboard — estadísticas globales de la compañía
GET {{base}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# HEALTH CHECK
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 32. Health check
GET {{host}}/health

###
